WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:03.500
Shriv: **Restoration**, you’re clear to attack. Everyone else, pull back!

00:00:13.740 --> 00:00:14.500
Del: That's not good.

00:00:15.880 --> 00:00:18.210
Shriv: I’m sorry. Are we not looking at the same burning Star Destroyer?

00:00:18.500 --> 00:00:24.720
Iden: Imperial protocol is to jump away to a safe location. Those ships are headed straight for Theed. They’re gonna attack the city.

00:00:25.560 --> 00:00:29.500
Leia: Everyone get to Theed as quickly as you can. We may have the means to stop this.
